%% Sprint Studies-Reform — Sequence: recommendations engine pipeline (RF-06)
%% Spec: Docs/specs/sprint-studies-reform.md (RF-06)
%% ADR: 068 (cross-feature recommendations engine)
%% Fluxo: RecommendationsView → endpoint → service parallel pipeline → merge + score → cache → activity invalidation

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Jogador
    participant RV as RecommendationsView<br/>(/estudos/recomendacoes)
    participant Cache as TanStack Query<br/>(staleTime 5min)
    participant API as GET /api/study/recommendations
    participant Auth as requireAuth (JWT)
    participant Service as studyRecommendationsService.ts
    participant DetectLeaks as detectLeaks()<br/>server/studies-v2.ts
    participant Storage as storage.ts
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant ActivityHooks as useStudyActivityInvalidation
    participant Telemetry as telemetry log

    Note over User,DB: Pre-condicao: usuario autenticado, plano Pro+ opcional<br/>(endpoint open ao authed; tier filtra apenas resultados especificos se aplicavel)

    %% ===== Render inicial =====
    User->>RV: abre /estudos/recomendacoes
    RV->>Cache: useQuery(['study','recommendations',userId])

    alt cache fresh (idade &lt; 5min)
        Cache-->>RV: dados cached
        RV->>User: render top 10 imediatamente (sem skeleton)
    else cache stale ou ausente
        Cache->>API: fetch GET /api/study/recommendations
        Cache-->>RV: skeleton 5 cards (loading)

        %% ===== Auth + chamada do service =====
        API->>Auth: requireAuth
        Auth-->>API: req.user.userPlatformId

        API->>Service: getRecommendations(userId, limit=10)

        %% ===== Pipeline parallel (Promise.allSettled) =====
        par Source 1: Stats Leaks
            Service->>DetectLeaks: getStatsLeaks(userId, top=5)
            DetectLeaks->>DB: SELECT analytics<br/>WHERE user_id=? AND tournaments_count&gt;=50
            DB-->>DetectLeaks: stats snapshots + tournaments
            DetectLeaks->>DetectLeaks: severity calculation
            DetectLeaks-->>Service: [{leak_type, severity, ...}, ...]
        and Source 2: Stale Spots
            Service->>Storage: getStaleSpots(userId, ageDays=7)
            Storage->>DB: SELECT s.* FROM starred_hands s<br/>LEFT JOIN study_theme_spot_links l<br/>  ON l.spot_id = s.id<br/>WHERE s.user_id=?<br/>  AND s.review_later=true<br/>  AND s.created_at &lt; NOW() - INTERVAL '7 days'<br/>  AND l.id IS NULL<br/>ORDER BY s.created_at ASC<br/>LIMIT 20
            DB-->>Storage: stale spots
            Storage-->>Service: [{spotId, type, age_days, ...}, ...]
        and Source 3: Dormant Themes
            Service->>Storage: getDormantThemes(userId, progress=30, dormancyDays=30)
            Storage->>DB: SELECT t.* FROM study_themes t<br/>LEFT JOIN study_tabs tb ON tb.theme_id=t.id<br/>WHERE t.user_id=?<br/>  AND t.progress &lt; 30<br/>  AND COALESCE(t.last_visited_at, t.updated_at)<br/>      &lt; NOW() - INTERVAL '30 days'<br/>GROUP BY t.id<br/>ORDER BY t.last_visited_at ASC<br/>LIMIT 20
            DB-->>Storage: dormant themes
            Storage-->>Service: [{themeId, progress, dormancy_days, ...}, ...]
        end

        %% ===== Failure handling (Promise.allSettled) =====
        Service->>Service: collect Promise.allSettled results

        alt source[0] (leaks) rejected
            Service->>Telemetry: study_recommendations_source_failed<br/>{source:'leaks', error}
            Note over Service: Lesson #9 — log antes de fallback.<br/>Usuario com 0 torneios importados:<br/>detectLeaks lanca, mas spots/themes ainda funcionam.
        end
        alt source[1] (spots) rejected
            Service->>Telemetry: study_recommendations_source_failed<br/>{source:'stale_spots', error}
        end
        alt source[2] (themes) rejected
            Service->>Telemetry: study_recommendations_source_failed<br/>{source:'dormant_themes', error}
        end

        %% ===== Merge + priority score =====
        Service->>Service: mapLeakToRecommendation(leak)<br/>score = leakSeverity × 1.5 + sourceBonus
        Service->>Service: mapSpotToRecommendation(spot)<br/>score = spotAgeDays × 0.3 + sourceBonus
        Service->>Service: mapThemeToRecommendation(theme)<br/>score = themeDormancyDays × 0.1 + sourceBonus

        Service->>Service: merge arrays
        Service->>Service: sort by priority_score DESC
        Service->>Service: slice(0, 10)
        Service->>Service: normalize score to 0-100

        %% ===== Telemetry sucesso =====
        Service->>Telemetry: study_recommendations_generated<br/>{userId, items_count, source_counts, latency_ms}

        Service-->>API: {items, generated_at, source_counts}
        API-->>Cache: 200 OK<br/>{items: [...], generated_at, source_counts}
        Cache->>Cache: store with staleTime: 5min, gcTime: 10min
        Cache-->>RV: data ready
    end

    %% ===== Render =====
    RV->>User: render lista priority_score DESC<br/>com badge type (leak/spot/theme)<br/>+ progress bar score 0-100<br/>+ CTA action

    alt items.length &gt; 0
        RV->>User: render 10 cards
    else items.length === 0
        RV->>User: render EmptyState<br/>"Nenhuma recomendacao agora<br/>— voce esta em dia!<br/>[Continuar estudando]"
        Note over RV: source_counts permite copy especifico<br/>"Voce tem 5 leaks mas nenhum supera severidade 3"
    end

    %% ===== Click em recomendacao =====
    User->>RV: click em card
    RV->>Telemetry: studies.recommendation_clicked<br/>{rec_type, priority_score, position}

    alt cta_action = 'create_theme'
        RV->>RV: navigate /estudos/temas?fromStats=leaks<br/>+ pre-fill CreateThemeDialog
    else cta_action = 'review_spot'
        RV->>RV: navigate /estudos/spots?spotId=spotId<br/>+ open SpotReviewCard modal
    else cta_action = 'open_theme'
        RV->>RV: navigate /estudos/temas/themeId
    end

    %% ===== Activity invalidation (D3 alinhado com streak) =====
    Note over User,Cache: Em outras views, activity dispara invalidation:

    User->>ActivityHooks: ThemeDetail mount<br/>(visita tema)
    ActivityHooks->>Cache: invalidateQueries(['study','recommendations',userId])
    Note over Cache: Proximo render de RecommendationsView<br/>re-fetch (cache marcado stale)

    User->>ActivityHooks: SpotReviewCard submit<br/>(revisar spot)
    ActivityHooks->>Cache: invalidateQueries(['study','recommendations',userId])

    User->>ActivityHooks: Stats Analyzer snapshot create
    ActivityHooks->>Cache: invalidateQueries(['study','recommendations',userId])

    Note over Cache,DB: Cache invalida = proxima visita<br/>regenera recomendacoes baseadas<br/>no novo state do usuario.<br/>Loop de feedback: estudou tema dormente → some da lista → leak fica no topo.

    %% ===== Coach tool reusa storage (RF-07) =====
    Note over Service,DB: Coach tool read_theme_with_linked_spots reusa<br/>mesmo storage.getLinkedSpots(themeId, userId).<br/>Zero duplicacao = cache Anthropic preservado<br/>(lesson #10).
